# 必考词 Unit 29 短语

## 常考短语

- **a joint venture**: 合资企业 — The two companies formed a joint venture. 两家公司成立了合资企业。
- **verify the facts**: 核实事实 — The journalist verified the facts before publishing. 记者在发布前核实了事实。
- **via email/Internet**: 通过电子邮件/互联网 — Please send the report via email. 请通过电子邮件发送报告。
- **fall victim to**: 成为…的受害者 — Many people fall victim to scams. 许多人成为骗局的受害者。
- **in view of**: 鉴于 — In view of the circumstances, we decided to postpone. 鉴于情况，我们决定推迟。
- **violate the law**: 违反法律 — Anyone who violates the law will be punished. 任何违反法律的人都将受到惩罚。
- **of vital importance**: 至关重要 — Education is of vital importance. 教育至关重要。
- **a vivid memory**: 清晰的记忆 — She has a vivid memory of the event. 她对那次事件记忆犹新。
- **a large volume of**: 大量的 — A large volume of data was processed. 处理了大量数据。
- **voluntary work**: 志愿工作 — She does voluntary work on weekends. 她周末做志愿工作。
- **vote for/against**: 投票赞成/反对 — The majority voted for the proposal. 大多数人投票赞成这项提案。
- **be vulnerable to**: 易受…伤害 — The system is vulnerable to attack. 系统容易受到攻击。
- **wage a war/campaign**: 发动战争/运动 — The government waged a campaign against corruption. 政府发动了反腐运动。
- **wander through**: 漫步穿过 — He wandered through the forest. 他漫步穿过森林。
- **warrant attention**: 值得关注 — The issue warrants our attention. 这个问题值得关注。
- **on welfare**: 靠福利生活 — Many families are on welfare. 许多家庭靠福利生活。
- **be willing to do**: 愿意做 — She is willing to accept the challenge. 她愿意接受挑战。
- **withdraw from**: 退出 — He withdrew from the competition. 他退出了比赛。
- **bear witness to**: 证明 — The ruins bear witness to the city's history. 废墟见证了城市的历史。
- **yield to**: 屈服于 — She refused to yield to pressure. 她拒绝屈服于压力。
